{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43564","headline":"杏园联句 · 李绦","name":"杏园联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杏园千树欲随风，一醉同人此暂同。\n老态忽忘丝管里，衰颜宜解酒杯中。\n曲江日暮残红在，翰苑年深旧事空。\n二十四年流落者，故人相引到花丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}